if you want to vote on
the next seven ways video

00:17:12.275 --> 00:17:14.112
that I make, there's a
link in the description.

00:17:14.112 --> 00:17:15.948
Go check it out, go have your say.

00:17:15.948 --> 00:17:19.037
Cast your vote and I might
make it in a future edition.

